 "text": [
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 64,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A/B test report · online medical consultation"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h1",
   "y": 104,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 840,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Faster answers, flat completion — and one department left behind"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 242,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 720,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Over six weeks, 18,000 users of an online consultation service were split into an experiment group and a control group. The experiment cut the wait for a doctor's first reply by about a fifth and almost eliminated long waits. Overall completion did not budge. In dermatology, however, it fell sharply."
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 400,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 176,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Data: 18,000 consultations"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 400,
   "x": 342,
   "w": 146,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18 Nov – 29 Dec 2024"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 400,
   "x": 514,
   "w": 184,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "5 departments · 3 platforms"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 473,
   "x": 167,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Median first reply"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 473,
   "x": 457,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completion, overall"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 473,
   "x": 747,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completion, dermatology"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 473,
   "x": 1036,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Abandoned, dermatology"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 501,
   "x": 167,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "88"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 501,
   "x": 457,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "87.94"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 501,
   "x": 747,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "80.51"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 501,
   "x": 1036,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "12.71"
  },
  {
   "tag": "small",
   "y": 515,
   "x": 207,
   "w": 8,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "s%%%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 546,
   "x": 167,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "against 110 s in control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 546,
   "x": 457,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "against 88.02% in control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 546,
   "x": 747,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "against 85.04% in control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 546,
   "x": 1036,
   "w": 237,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "against 7.66% in control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 673,
   "x": 275,
   "w": 492,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "A clean split, run on a growing service"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 688,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 117,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "01 — The test"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 737,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The file holds 18,000 consultations entered between 18 November and 29 December 2024. 8,987 were assigned to the experiment group and 9,013 to the control group — a 49.9 / 50.1 split that is even enough to compare the two directly."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4",
   "y": 758,
   "x": 746,
   "w": 533,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Weekly consultations by group"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 784,
   "x": 746,
   "w": 533,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Six full weeks, both arms tracked together · 2,409 in the first week, 3,546 in the last"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 845,
   "x": 758,
   "w": 26,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "2000"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 907,
   "x": 760,
   "w": 23,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "1500"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 912,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Traffic grew steadily through the period, from 2,409 consultations in the first week to 3,546 in the last, and the two groups kept pace with each other week by week. That matters: if the experiment had been switched on mid-way, or had taken a disproportionate share of the later weeks, any difference in outcomes could be a difference in timing rather than in treatment."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 970,
   "x": 760,
   "w": 24,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "1000"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1032,
   "x": 764,
   "w": 19,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "500"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1094,
   "x": 777,
   "w": 6,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "0"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1098,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The population is balanced on the dimensions that could otherwise confound the result. The department mix is close — dermatology was 16.7% of experiment traffic against 17.9% of control — and the three platforms (Android, iOS, WeChat mini-program) are within a few points of each other. Roughly two thirds of users are returning patients, again in similar proportion on both sides."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 808,
   "w": 49,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18–24 Nov"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 879,
   "w": 64,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "25 Nov–1 Dec"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 970,
   "w": 39,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "2–8 Dec"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 1047,
   "w": 43,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "9–15 Dec"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 1123,
   "w": 49,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "16–22 Dec"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1110,
   "x": 1200,
   "w": 51,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "23–29 Dec"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1153,
   "x": 748,
   "w": 84,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Experiment"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1153,
   "x": 852,
   "w": 60,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1285,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The service covers five departments: paediatrics (儿科), internal medicine (内科), dermatology (皮肤科), gynaecology (妇科) and ENT/ophthalmology (五官科)."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 1441,
   "x": 252,
   "w": 735,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The waiting time is where the experiment clearly worked"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 1456,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 94,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "02 — Speed"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1506,
   "x": 725,
   "w": 575,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The median wait for a first doctor response fell from 110 seconds in control to 88 seconds in the experiment. The share of users answered within two minutes rose from 53.8% to 68.6%."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4",
   "y": 1527,
   "x": 161,
   "w": 501,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "How long users waited for a doctor's first reply"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1552,
   "x": 161,
   "w": 501,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Share of answered consultations in each band · labels read experiment / control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1605,
   "x": 197,
   "w": 30,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "< 30 s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1606,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 36,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "2.6 / 1.4"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1647,
   "x": 189,
   "w": 39,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "30–60 s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1647,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 45,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "21.3 / 13.6"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1649,
   "x": 725,
   "w": 575,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The bigger change is in the tail. In control, 385 consultations waited more than five minutes for a doctor; in the experiment only 90 did. The single longest wait in control ran to 71,396 seconds — nearly twenty hours — against 18,669 seconds in the experiment."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1688,
   "x": 189,
   "w": 39,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "60–90 s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1689,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 46,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "27.7 / 21.9"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1730,
   "x": 185,
   "w": 43,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "90–120 s"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1730,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 45,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "20.3 / 19.1"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1771,
   "x": 190,
   "w": 38,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "2–3 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1772,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 45,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "18.5 / 24.1"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1780,
   "x": 725,
   "w": 575,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "This is not a gain produced by one busy department. The median wait fell in all five departments, from 105 to 82 seconds in 五官科, from 107 to 86 in 皮肤科, and by a similar margin everywhere else. Whatever the experiment changed in routing or staffing, it changed it across the whole service."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1812,
   "x": 190,
   "w": 38,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "3–5 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1813,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 41,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "8.6 / 15.5"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1854,
   "x": 186,
   "w": 42,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "5–10 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1854,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 33,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "1.1 / 4.3"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1895,
   "x": 187,
   "w": 40,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "10 min +"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 1896,
   "x": 612,
   "w": 38,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "0.0 / 0.3"
  },
  {
