   "x": 900,
   "w": 130,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "902"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1959,
   "x": 163,
   "w": 84,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Experiment"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 1959,
   "x": 267,
   "w": 60,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Control"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 1974,
   "x": 725,
   "w": 135,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "answered ≤ 2 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 1974,
   "x": 900,
   "w": 130,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "waits over 5 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 1974,
   "x": 1070,
   "w": 136,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "waits over 10 min"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 2112,
   "x": 305,
   "w": 861,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Overall, the faster service completed exactly as many consultations"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 2127,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 147,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "03 — Completion"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2176,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "87.94% of experiment consultations reached completion, against 88.02% in control — 7,903 of 8,987 versus 7,933 of 9,013. A difference of eight hundredths of a percentage point is noise."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 2288,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 760,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The same holds for the users who gave up before a doctor ever picked up the case: 5.30% in the experiment against 4.74% in control. Slightly worse, but small enough that on its own it would not justify a decision either way. Seven-day follow-up was likewise unchanged, at 12.15% against 12.31%. Completed consultations did run shorter — a median of 10.4 minutes against 11.2 — consistent with a faster, more tightly triaged flow."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4",
   "y": 2468,
   "x": 161,
   "w": 521,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Completion by department"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4",
   "y": 2468,
   "x": 758,
   "w": 521,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Left before reaching a doctor"
