   "x": 140,
   "w": 169,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "04 — The exception"
  },
  {
   "tag": "span",
   "y": 3064,
   "x": 179,
   "w": 154,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Signal, not noise"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3106,
   "x": 179,
   "w": 820,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "In 皮肤科 the experiment group completed 80.51% of consultations against 85.04% in control. Abandonment before a doctor rose from 7.66% to 12.71% — 124 of 1,618 users in control, 191 of 1,503 in the experiment. Every other department moved by less than a point and a half, and paediatrics moved the other way, up to 90.37% from 88.94%."
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 3240,
   "x": 179,
   "w": 156,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "−4.5 pts"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 3240,
   "x": 379,
   "w": 172,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "+5.1 pts"
  },
  {
   "tag": "div",
   "y": 3240,
   "x": 595,
   "w": 158,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "6 of 6"
  },
