   "tag": "div",
   "y": 3284,
   "x": 595,
   "w": 158,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "weeks with the same gap"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h3",
   "y": 3371,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Why this is unlikely to be chance"
  },
  {
   "tag": "h4",
   "y": 3392,
   "x": 746,
   "w": 533,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Dermatology completion, week by week"
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "y": 3407,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "It repeats every week. The experiment trails control in all six weeks of the test, from 83.6% against 84.0% in the first week to 79.4% against 83.7% in the last. A fluke would not hold a direction for six consecutive weeks."
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 3418,
   "x": 746,
   "w": 533,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The gap opens early and never closes"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 3463,
   "x": 761,
   "w": 23,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "90%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 3527,
   "x": 761,
   "w": 23,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "86%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "li",
   "y": 3533,
   "x": 140,
   "w": 543,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "It hits every skin complaint. Back rash falls from 86.9% to 79.4%, hives from 85.5% to 78.7%, acne from 86.1% to 82.2%, and the two remaining complaints lose ground as well. No single complaint carries the result."
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 3563,
   "x": 1223,
   "w": 34,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "83.7%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 3590,
   "x": 761,
   "w": 23,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "82%"
  },
  {
   "tag": "text",
   "y": 3632,
   "x": 1223,
   "w": 35,
   "in_svg": true,
   "hidden": false,
